1
00:00:08,636 --> 00:00:14,448
♪Myriad delusions cut like knives♪

2
00:00:14,448 --> 00:00:20,416
♪Crushing the moon in the ancient well♪

3
00:00:20,598 --> 00:00:25,536
♪Lost in this life,
I never ask about tomorrow♪

4
00:00:25,536 --> 00:00:31,216
♪When love runs deep,
the moonlight fades♪

5
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:39,851
♪A cursed fate,
a dream severed over lifetimes♪

6
00:00:40,662 --> 00:00:44,310
=Braving the Famine with My Wife=

7
00:00:44,599 --> 00:00:46,778
=Episode 8=

8
00:00:51,439 --> 00:00:52,439
Lay a finger on me,

9
00:00:52,700 --> 00:00:54,439
and I will cut you to pieces

10
00:00:55,039 --> 00:00:56,039
and wipe out your clan.

11
00:00:57,520 --> 00:01:00,359
You should be thinking about
how to please me,

12
00:01:00,899 --> 00:01:02,219
so you can get your antidote.

13
00:01:03,219 --> 00:01:07,060
Now, allow me
to serve you, Your Majesty.

14
00:01:16,480 --> 00:01:17,480
Zhao Dong?

15
00:01:17,920 --> 00:01:18,920
Why are you here?

16
00:01:19,140 --> 00:01:21,200
Xi Yun, why the long face?

17
00:01:21,640 --> 00:01:23,159
Aren't you happy to see me?

18
00:01:25,319 --> 00:01:26,980
It's dangerous here. Leave now.

19
00:01:26,980 --> 00:01:28,299
Think you can just leave?

20
00:01:29,200 --> 00:01:30,200
Who are you?

21
00:01:31,099 --> 00:01:32,340
Are you deaf or just blind?

22
00:01:32,739 --> 00:01:33,920
I'm obviously her man.

23
00:01:34,239 --> 00:01:35,879
You ignorant peasant!

24
00:01:36,359 --> 00:01:37,500
Do you know who she is?

25
00:01:38,719 --> 00:01:39,719
Of course, I do.

26
00:01:40,659 --> 00:01:43,420
She's my woman.

27
00:01:44,920 --> 00:01:45,920
You...

28
00:01:48,319 --> 00:01:49,319
Right?

29
00:01:49,620 --> 00:01:50,900
That was just temporary.

30
00:01:51,840 --> 00:01:53,459
Actually, I am...

31
00:01:56,599 --> 00:01:57,599
Did you just spank me?

32
00:01:58,200 --> 00:01:59,500
A small punishment for you.

33
00:01:59,739 --> 00:02:01,040
I told you before,

34
00:02:01,359 --> 00:02:02,760
I don't mind your backgrounds.

35
00:02:02,959 --> 00:02:03,959
You!

36
00:02:03,959 --> 00:02:04,959
You wretch!

37
00:02:05,500 --> 00:02:08,400
Come over here right now,

38
00:02:09,000 --> 00:02:11,840
and I might consider
sparing your worthless life.

39
00:02:13,520 --> 00:02:15,680
You're surprisingly generous.

40
00:02:15,860 --> 00:02:17,860
Why not just kill yourself
as an apology?

41
00:02:18,219 --> 00:02:21,340
I promise I'll bury you
in a nice plot of land,

42
00:02:21,620 --> 00:02:24,919
so your descendants can rise.

43
00:02:24,919 --> 00:02:25,919
What do you think?

44
00:02:30,819 --> 00:02:32,199
You are seeking death!

45
00:02:32,199 --> 00:02:34,120
Zhao Dong, don't provoke him.

46
00:02:34,439 --> 00:02:36,080
Not only is he the best in martial arts,

47
00:02:36,960 --> 00:02:38,240
but he also has a strong army.

48
00:02:38,400 --> 00:02:39,520
The best in martial arts?

49
00:02:42,759 --> 00:02:43,759
Interesting.

50
00:02:44,259 --> 00:02:46,020
I'd actually like to spar with him.

51
00:02:48,099 --> 00:02:49,699
Don't act on impulse.

52
00:02:49,840 --> 00:02:51,240
Swallow your pride.

53
00:02:51,639 --> 00:02:52,639
I'll convince him

54
00:02:52,639 --> 00:02:53,639
to spare your life.

55
00:02:53,860 --> 00:02:54,860
You just leave

56
00:02:54,860 --> 00:02:55,860
and go into hiding.

57
00:02:58,340 --> 00:03:01,580
Darling, what you said
is really touching.

58
00:03:02,060 --> 00:03:04,080
But I don't need it.

59
00:03:07,539 --> 00:03:09,000
Your phoenix's majesty,

60
00:03:09,400 --> 00:03:10,400
crowned in purple aura.

61
00:03:11,840 --> 00:03:13,340
With a tilt of your hairpin,

62
00:03:13,900 --> 00:03:14,900
the stars seem to tumble.

63
00:03:15,860 --> 00:03:18,259
Do not say the earth holds no beauty.

64
00:03:19,400 --> 00:03:20,620
The vast lands exist

65
00:03:21,360 --> 00:03:22,479
only to adorn you.

66
00:03:24,414 --> 00:03:25,414
Beautiful.

67
00:03:25,414 --> 00:03:28,674
(Affection -30)

68
00:03:30,740 --> 00:03:33,319
You scum! I'm right here.

69
00:03:33,620 --> 00:03:35,080
Say your last words,

70
00:03:35,560 --> 00:03:38,379
because your time is up.

71
00:03:38,379 --> 00:03:39,379
You're seeking death!

72
00:03:43,740 --> 00:03:44,740
Why can't I move?

73
00:03:44,939 --> 00:03:45,939
What are you going to do?

74
00:03:47,780 --> 00:03:49,000
I have a wife

75
00:03:49,460 --> 00:03:50,460
who's very timid.

76
00:03:51,680 --> 00:03:52,879
I lured her into marrying me.

77
00:03:54,199 --> 00:03:55,900
She was nearly humiliated because of me.

78
00:03:58,639 --> 00:03:59,639
But she told me

79
00:03:59,919 --> 00:04:01,199
that she'd follow me

80
00:04:01,539 --> 00:04:02,659
no matter what happens.

81
00:04:03,060 --> 00:04:05,360
Even if I tried to send her away,
she wouldn't leave.

82
00:04:07,500 --> 00:04:08,659
So I swore

83
00:04:09,300 --> 00:04:10,900
I would protect her forever,

84
00:04:11,759 --> 00:04:15,000
and never let her suffer
any harm or humiliation again.

85
00:04:18,740 --> 00:04:22,560
That single strike of yours
didn't just shatter her heart meridian,

86
00:04:23,160 --> 00:04:24,459
but also broke my vow.

87
00:04:25,100 --> 00:04:26,560
You tell me what I'm going to do.

88
00:04:28,339 --> 00:04:30,560
She was just a woman
of lowly status. Just let her die.

89
00:04:30,800 --> 00:04:31,800
Spare my life,

90
00:04:32,160 --> 00:04:34,540
and I'll get you any woman you want.

91
00:04:34,759 --> 00:04:35,759
Chu Yunxi.

92
00:04:35,759 --> 00:04:36,759
She's the Empress.

93
00:04:36,819 --> 00:04:37,819
I'll give her to you.

94
00:04:38,079 --> 00:04:39,079
You...

95
00:04:39,079 --> 00:04:40,360
I can spare your life.

96
00:04:41,439 --> 00:04:42,962
You killed Cuicui with a palm strike.

97
00:04:43,519 --> 00:04:44,860
Then I will return the favor.

98
00:05:11,879 --> 00:05:13,959
(Affection 10)
Pathetic! He couldn't even take one hit.

99
00:05:14,879 --> 00:05:17,399
Cuicui, I've avenged you.

100
00:05:17,800 --> 00:05:18,939
My poison isn't cured yet.

101
00:05:20,360 --> 00:05:21,360
Zhao Dong!

102
00:05:21,519 --> 00:05:22,519
Xi Yun.

103
00:05:22,519 --> 00:05:25,100
I've sent the man
who bullied you to death.

104
00:05:25,980 --> 00:05:28,459
He just said he was the only one
who could cure my poison.

105
00:05:28,579 --> 00:05:30,579
Yes, he did say that.

106
00:05:31,060 --> 00:05:32,060
You heard him,

107
00:05:32,060 --> 00:05:33,259
yet you still killed him?

108
00:05:33,600 --> 00:05:34,600
Yes.

109
00:05:34,959 --> 00:05:35,959
He bullied you

110
00:05:36,120 --> 00:05:37,160
and killed Cuicui.

111
00:05:37,600 --> 00:05:38,759
He has to die.

112
00:05:39,139 --> 00:05:40,139
You!

113
00:05:41,540 --> 00:05:42,600
He said

114
00:05:42,939 --> 00:05:44,600
he was the only one who could cure me.

115
00:05:44,839 --> 00:05:48,019
Couldn't you at least get the cure
out of him before killing him?

116
00:05:48,259 --> 00:05:50,699
You! You're going to get me killed!

117
00:05:53,540 --> 00:05:54,660
You're worrying about this?

118
00:05:55,639 --> 00:05:56,639
Don't worry.

119
00:05:56,980 --> 00:05:59,199
I can cure any poison in this world.

120
00:06:00,540 --> 00:06:02,220
I know you have some martial skills,

121
00:06:02,699 --> 00:06:05,839
but that doesn't mean
you can cure every rare poison.

122
00:06:06,180 --> 00:06:07,439
What makes you so confident?

123
00:06:07,439 --> 00:06:08,439
Enough already.

124
00:06:08,540 --> 00:06:09,600
I promise you

125
00:06:10,079 --> 00:06:11,639
that if I can't cure your poison,

126
00:06:12,240 --> 00:06:13,319
I'll join you in death.

127
00:06:14,439 --> 00:06:15,439
Let's go home.

128
00:06:15,519 --> 00:06:16,519
Cuicui is waiting for us.

129
00:06:17,220 --> 00:06:18,220
Zhao Dong.

130
00:06:20,500 --> 00:06:21,899
How about we make a deal?

131
00:06:25,519 --> 00:06:26,759
To help you regain your power?

132
00:06:28,600 --> 00:06:29,600
Exactly.

133
00:06:30,040 --> 00:06:31,699
If you help me regain my power,

134
00:06:32,220 --> 00:06:33,720
I'll make you a prime minister

135
00:06:34,000 --> 00:06:35,000
and reward you with gold,

136
00:06:35,279 --> 00:06:36,839
making you rise above others.

137
00:06:37,759 --> 00:06:39,120
Fame and fortune

138
00:06:39,480 --> 00:06:40,579
mean nothing to me.

139
00:06:41,579 --> 00:06:43,060
All I want

140
00:06:44,480 --> 00:06:46,000
is to be on top of you.

141
00:06:46,540 --> 00:06:49,379
You! You shameless man!

142
00:06:51,139 --> 00:06:52,300
(Affection 15)
She's cursing me out,

143
00:06:52,620 --> 00:06:54,000
but why did her Affection go up?

144
00:06:54,699 --> 00:06:55,699
She's so insincere.

145
00:06:56,620 --> 00:06:57,939
I was betrayed by villains

146
00:06:58,279 --> 00:06:59,319
and forced to escape.

147
00:06:59,699 --> 00:07:00,699
I took the alias Xi Yun,

148
00:07:00,699 --> 00:07:01,699
and had no choice

149
00:07:02,000 --> 00:07:03,500
but to become your wife.

150
00:07:04,019 --> 00:07:06,480
So everything that happened
before doesn't count.

151
00:07:06,839 --> 00:07:07,939
If you dare covet me again,

152
00:07:08,379 --> 00:07:09,480
I will not let you off.

153
00:07:10,540 --> 00:07:12,899
Fine. I'll write
a divorce letter to you then.

154
00:07:13,860 --> 00:07:16,180
No, to Xi Yun.

155
00:07:18,800 --> 00:07:20,800
Zhao Dong, you'd better think twice.

156
00:07:21,639 --> 00:07:23,579
I'll do anything for my woman.

157
00:07:24,060 --> 00:07:26,600
But I don't care about
anyone and anything else.

158
00:07:28,899 --> 00:07:30,519
(He is truly despicable.)

159
00:07:31,000 --> 00:07:32,259
(He covets me)

160
00:07:32,259 --> 00:07:33,300
(and tries to control me.)

161
00:07:33,839 --> 00:07:35,240
(What a wicked man!)

162
00:07:35,899 --> 00:07:38,660
(But I have nowhere else to go)

163
00:07:38,839 --> 00:07:40,000
(and no one else to rely on.)

164
00:07:41,019 --> 00:07:42,220
(I have to depend on him.)

165
00:07:47,220 --> 00:07:49,439
Sir, something terrible has happened!

166
00:07:49,439 --> 00:07:50,439
Xu...

167
00:07:51,060 --> 00:07:52,740
What happened to him? Spit it out!

168
00:07:52,740 --> 00:07:54,319
Xu took some men to kill Zhao Laizi.

169
00:07:54,639 --> 00:07:56,500
But Zhao Laizi went home safe and sound,

170
00:07:56,579 --> 00:07:58,120
and Xu and his men were all dead.

171
00:07:59,680 --> 00:08:00,680
Darn it!

172
00:08:01,480 --> 00:08:05,120
Zhao Laizi and Xu's wife
were having an affair long ago.

173
00:08:05,560 --> 00:08:07,060
Xu had wanted to kill him.

174
00:08:08,040 --> 00:08:09,759
If we go after Zhao Laizi now,

175
00:08:10,019 --> 00:08:11,620
the Zhang family will protect him.

176
00:08:14,920 --> 00:08:15,920
Here's the thing.

177
00:08:27,519 --> 00:08:29,100
Here's the divorce letter. Take it.

178
00:08:29,100 --> 00:08:30,100
(Divorce Letter)

179
00:08:30,779 --> 00:08:31,800
How dare you divorce me?

180
00:08:33,240 --> 00:08:35,980
I have never suffered such humiliation.
Zhao Dong, you...

181
00:08:35,980 --> 00:08:36,980
I'm divorcing Xi Yun,

182
00:08:37,100 --> 00:08:38,299
not you, Chu Yunxi.

183
00:08:38,740 --> 00:08:39,740
Why are you so worked up?

184
00:08:42,779 --> 00:08:45,139
This bundle has some food and silver,

185
00:08:45,240 --> 00:08:46,584
enough to get you by for a while.

186
00:08:46,860 --> 00:08:48,000
Your Majesty,

187
00:08:48,600 --> 00:08:51,299
I wish you a swift return to the throne

188
00:08:51,460 --> 00:08:52,460
to rule the nation.

189
00:08:54,600 --> 00:08:56,919
Your Majesty, please go.

190
00:08:58,600 --> 00:08:59,740
Are you kicking me out?

191
00:09:01,600 --> 00:09:03,100
My house is quite small,

192
00:09:03,379 --> 00:09:04,379
and I have many wives.

193
00:09:04,679 --> 00:09:06,399
There's simply no room

194
00:09:06,600 --> 00:09:08,600
for an outsider. Please forgive me.

195
00:09:08,860 --> 00:09:11,879
Fine. You're just a useless one,

196
00:09:12,440 --> 00:09:15,159
unable to seize the opportunity to rise.

197
00:09:19,399 --> 00:09:22,039
(Scum, if you come
and beg me to stay right now,)

198
00:09:22,340 --> 00:09:23,600
(I will spare your life.)

199
00:09:26,720 --> 00:09:29,320
(Why hasn't he come to ask me to stay?)

200
00:09:34,679 --> 00:09:37,340
(How dare he do this to me?)

201
00:09:38,120 --> 00:09:39,639
(Not only am I of noble status,)

202
00:09:39,899 --> 00:09:41,614
(but I'm also
the greatest beauty in Qian.)

203
00:09:41,940 --> 00:09:44,860
(How dare he kick me out!
I can't believe it!)

204
00:09:45,519 --> 00:09:47,513
(I am the Empress.
I know when to yield.)

205
00:09:47,513 --> 00:09:49,620
(I'll just stay. Let's see
what you can do about it.)

206
00:09:50,379 --> 00:09:51,860
(Besides, my poison isn't cured.)

207
00:09:52,559 --> 00:09:54,860
(Exactly, I need to stay
for the antidote.)

208
00:09:54,860 --> 00:09:56,790
(Affection 20)

209
00:10:15,360 --> 00:10:17,539
(Although Cuicui's soul
is sealed inside her body,)

210
00:10:17,879 --> 00:10:19,440
(it's slowly dissipating bit by bit.)

211
00:10:20,620 --> 00:10:23,200
(I must use my Soul Power
to nurture her.)

212
00:10:42,620 --> 00:10:43,620
(Got you.)

213
00:11:02,972 --> 00:11:06,563
♪With a clap of thunder,
you were cast into the mortal realm♪

214
00:11:06,563 --> 00:11:09,350
♪Silk robes replaced by rags♪

215
00:11:09,926 --> 00:11:12,088
♪Immortal bones buried in the dust♪

216
00:11:12,088 --> 00:11:14,934
♪One thought once stirred the seas♪

217
00:11:14,934 --> 00:11:18,212
♪Now, even cold porridge
is a lucky find♪

218
00:11:18,212 --> 00:11:19,846
♪She was cast out of the golden hall♪

219
00:11:19,846 --> 00:11:21,910
♪With only half a tattered decree♪

220
00:11:21,910 --> 00:11:23,446
♪Her eyes still held a blade's edge♪

221
00:11:23,446 --> 00:11:26,228
♪Saying this world
isn't worth a single moment♪

222
00:11:26,677 --> 00:11:28,582
♪You handed her a bowl of coarse tea♪

223
00:11:28,582 --> 00:11:34,613
♪Telling her to taste
life's bitter and sweet♪

224
00:11:35,195 --> 00:11:39,078
♪So the Supreme Immortal
can fall to dust♪

225
00:11:39,078 --> 00:11:42,303
♪So the Empress
can feel her heart turn cold♪

226
00:11:42,815 --> 00:11:45,414
♪You watched the sunset
in a narrow alley with her♪

227
00:11:45,414 --> 00:11:50,542
♪Hearing a child cry out in pain,
yet still laughing, so silly♪

228
00:11:50,542 --> 00:11:54,070
♪So power is no match
for a bowl of warm porridge♪

229
00:11:54,070 --> 00:11:57,778
♪So heaven can't compare
to a lamp in a broken hut♪

230
00:11:57,778 --> 00:11:59,670
♪From strangers to aching hearts♪

231
00:11:59,670 --> 00:12:01,747
♪From cold words to genuine care♪

232
00:12:01,747 --> 00:12:04,278
♪In the humblest corners
of the mortal world♪

233
00:12:04,278 --> 00:12:08,315
♪You met the most precious person♪

234
00:12:09,983 --> 00:12:11,846
♪She said commoners are just numbers♪

235
00:12:11,846 --> 00:12:14,365
♪You took her to see
the fields turned to scars♪

236
00:12:14,365 --> 00:12:15,814
♪And the old man bent by firewood♪

237
00:12:15,814 --> 00:12:18,116
♪A lifetime of bitterness
on his shoulders♪

238
00:12:18,116 --> 00:12:20,086
♪For the first time,
she set aside her crown♪

239
00:12:20,086 --> 00:12:24,496
♪And held an umbrella
for a drenched street vendor♪

240
00:12:24,496 --> 00:12:26,038
♪You can no longer ride the clouds♪

241
00:12:26,038 --> 00:12:27,948
♪But only toss and turn in the night♪

242
00:12:27,948 --> 00:12:31,222
♪Still kneeling at Heaven's Gate
in your dreams♪

243
00:12:31,222 --> 00:12:34,543
♪Only to wake up
with a flatbread she tossed at you♪

244
00:12:34,543 --> 00:12:36,278
♪Saying, forget the gods♪

245
00:12:36,278 --> 00:12:40,902
♪Just catch your breath first♪

246
00:12:40,902 --> 00:12:44,652
♪So the Supreme Immortal
can fall to dust♪

247
00:12:44,652 --> 00:12:48,030
♪So the Empress can turn for someone♪

248
00:12:48,404 --> 00:12:50,374
♪No longer asking
who stands higher or mightier♪

249
00:12:50,374 --> 00:12:56,121
♪Only asking who stands
at your heart's door now♪

250
00:12:56,121 --> 00:12:59,637
♪If Heaven wants you to pass
through the street's rising smoke first♪

251
00:12:59,637 --> 00:13:01,206
♪If the mortal world cannot hold you♪

252
00:13:01,206 --> 00:13:03,516
♪Then carve the memories
into your palm lines♪

253
00:13:03,516 --> 00:13:05,254
♪From laughter to devotion♪

254
00:13:05,254 --> 00:13:07,310
♪From falling to innocence♪

255
00:13:07,310 --> 00:13:09,158
♪If there's a next life, you'll still♪

256
00:13:09,158 --> 00:13:15,828
♪Love a mortal once more
amidst this suffering♪
